flathub:io.github.hafmed.TP-Labo-Hyd.description:
A practical tool (for students, engineers and teachers) to provides calculation in practical works in fluid mechanic laboratory.
 Features:
 Rolling ball viscometer;
 Pressure Measurement and Calibration;
 Calculation of the hydrostatic force and the location of the center of pressure;
 Calculations in orifice meter and Venturi;
 dark and light Theme supported;
 English GUI.
